  "description": "<p>⭐Tickets for <strong>Up at The O2 in London.</strong> Enjoy stunning views of London's skyline from 52 meters high!</p><p><strong>Ticket types</strong><br />🎫 The Original Climb - Regular</p><p><strong>Highlights</strong><br />🏙️ Experience the breathtaking sights of London's timeless cityscape and the Thames while standing at the peak of The O2<br />🧗‍♂️ Encounter an electrifying ascent lasting 90 minutes on the iconic roof of The O2, kitted out with indispensable gear and a climbing outfit<br />🌄 Pick from a variety of climb schedules, comprising of dusk and twilight hours, and even pour a flute of sparkling wine upon arrival at the summit!<br /><br /><strong>General Info</strong><br />📅 Date and time: various dates and times are available (select during purchase)<br />📍 Location: The O2 Arena<br />⏳ Duration: one hour and thirty minutes<br />❗ For this event, all sales are final and tickets can’t be refunded, changed or modified. For more information, please refer to our <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/e/2PACX-1vSVRJ1Z5-8gFm17oKLfc1rcA_HQk0tfJdZ8J4EOwBjPOBrfX-AvXaaGoq7vPNos-r2V4U4PxCfXUyar/pub\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">T&amp;Cs</a></p><p><strong>Description</strong><br /><span>Prepare for an unforgettable adventure with Up at The O2! Ascend 52 meters above London's breathtaking skyline, treating yourself to spectacular views of the Thames River. With three climb options – daytime, sunset, or twilight – your experience promises to be nothing short of extraordinary. To top it off, you can even enjoy a glass of bubbly at the peak! What's more, we provide all the necessary equipment, and our wheelchair-accessible feature ensures that everyone can partake in the excitement. So, gear up, secure your harness, and brace yourself for a London experience like no other!</span></p>",
